title: Trailkasten
message: >-
  If you use this vault or its tooling, please cite the paper that
  describes the system (given under preferred-citation).
type: software
abstract: >-
  A Zettelkasten structured to be worked on with an AI assistant: an
  Obsidian vault plus a vocabulary of commands and skills for Claude
  Code. Released as the foundational structure described in
  "Permanently Under Construction" (ACM Hypertext 2026).
